@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Team Role API
	Testing Koroneiki Team Role API functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the team roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Default Account Role  |
	| Default Regular Role  |
	| Optional Account Role |
	| Optional Regular Role |

Scenario: Create and view account team role
	Koroneiki account team role created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |

Scenario: Create and view regular team role
	Koroneiki regular team roles created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for regulars |
	| Name        | Default Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                               |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Regular Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for regulars |
	| Name        | Default Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                               |

Scenario: Create and view multiple account team roles
	Multiple account team role created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Optional Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |

Scenario: Create and view multiple regular team roles
	Multiple regular team roles created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for regulars |
	| Name        | Default Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                               |
	And I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for regulars |
	| Name        | Optional Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                                |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Regular Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for regulars |
	| Name        | Default Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                               |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Optional Regular Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for regulars |
	| Name        | Optional Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                                |

Scenario: Update and view account team role
	Koroneiki account team role updated via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I update a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Optional Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role"

Scenario: Update and view regular team role
	Koroneiki regular team roles updated via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for regulars |
	| Name        | Default Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                               |
	And I update a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Regular Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for regulars |
	| Name        | Optional Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                                |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Optional Regular Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for regulars |
	| Name        | Optional Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                                |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Regular Role"

Scenario: Update no team role type and view
	Koroneiki account team role types should not be able to updated via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Regular Role                     |
	| Type        | Regular                                  |
	And I update a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                                   |
	And I update a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Regular Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for regulars |
	| Name        | Optional Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                             |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Optional Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Optional Regular Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for regulars |
	| Name        | Optional Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                                |

Scenario: Delete account team role and view
	Koroneiki account team role deleted via API should not be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I delete a team role on koroneiki with the name "Default Account Role"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role"

Scenario: Delete regular team role and view
	Koroneiki regular team roles deleted via API should not be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for regulars |
	| Name        | Default Regular Role                  |
	| Type        | Regular                               |
	And I delete a team role on koroneiki with the name "Default Regular Role"
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Regular Role"

Scenario: View team role audit entries
	Koroneiki team role changes via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I update a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	Then I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "" to the new value "Default Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki QA Service Producer"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Update" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "Default Account Role" to the new value "Optional Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki QA Service Producer"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "" to the new value "Default Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki QA Service Producer" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Update" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "Default Account Role" to the new value "Optional Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki QA Service Producer" via the audit entry key

Scenario: View team role audit entries executed by agent
	Koroneiki team role changes via API via an agent should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Agent Name  | Koroneiki User                        |
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I update a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" to have the following values
	| Agent Name  | Koroneiki User                        |
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	Then I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "" to the new value "Default Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki User"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Update" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "Default Account Role" to the new value "Optional Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki User"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "" to the new value "Default Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki User" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Update" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "Default Account Role" to the new value "Optional Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki User" via the audit entry key

Scenario: View team role audit entries executed by admin and agent
	Koroneiki team role changes via API via an agent and admin should be viewable via API.

	Given I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I update a koroneiki team role with the name "Default Account Role" to have the following values
	| Agent Name  | Koroneiki User                        |
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	Then I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "" to the new value "Default Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki QA Service Producer"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Update" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "Default Account Role" to the new value "Optional Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki User"
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Add" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "" to the new value "Default Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki QA Service Producer" via the audit entry key
	And I should be able to view an audit entry for an action "Update" to the team role "Optional Account Role" field "Name" from the old value "Default Account Role" to the new value "Optional Account Role" executed by "Koroneiki User" via the audit entry key